          <p>Most infrastructure projects involve multiple vendors, multiple contracts, and multiple handoffs. When something breaks, no one takes ownership — the network team blames the security team, the security team blames the cloud team, and the client is left coordinating blame.</p>
          <p>MEAICON replaces that with one contract, one team, and one accountability. We design, build, and operate. If the network is down, we fix it. If the security alert fires, we respond. If the server fails, we replace it. One number, one team, one partner who owns the outcome.</p>
          <p>That is the difference. Not more features. Not more promises. More accountability — backed by engineering depth, regional presence, and operational discipline.</p>
